## Key Concepts

- Kleene 3-valued logic: {T, F, U}
- A→B as ¬A ∨ B with ¬ and ∨ defined per Kleene semantics
- Constraint propagation and depth-limited backtracking
- Practical mapping to sensor fusion/telemetry validation in fleets

## Code Example

